{
  "category": "Rendezvous Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "LUVDISC live in shallow seas in the tropics. This heart-shaped POKéMON earned its name by swimming after loving couples it spotted in the ocean’s waves.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "LUVDISC’s heart-shaped body is a symbol of love and romance. It is said that any couple meeting this POKéMON is promised a loving relationship that never ends.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "LUVDISC make the branches of CORSOLA their nests. There is a custom from long ago of giving a LUVDISC as a gift to express one’s feelings of love.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
